<title>USA: Honeywell acquires  Interplant Consulting.</title>
<headline>Honeywell acquires  Interplant Consulting.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honeywell Inc said Tuesday it acquired  InterPlant Consulting Inc, a developer and marketer of a real-time database product and related plant information applications.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Interplant, based in Calgary, will be renamed Honeywell InterPlant and will be a wholly owned subsidiary of Honeywell Inc. With 20 employees, Honeywell InterPlant will function as part of Honeywell's Industrial Automation and Control business.</p>
<p>The acquisition enables Honeywell to extend its real-time database offering, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
